<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Dondo</book>
  <para style="h">2 TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wunzole wu Pawuli ku bisi-Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wunzole wu Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wunzole wusonika Pawuli ku minkwikidi mi mbanza Tesalonika. Mu mukanda bewuwu, wuna bazonzila dyaka mvutukulu yi Klisto, mpe bwedi bwaabela nsukunu yi yobobo bakwe kwikilanga mu yandi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bantu bahiika mu mbanza beyoyo bana kwe tengi ti Klisto wuvutukidi ha butoto, bahiika ha kati dyawu bana kwe tengi ti musamu bewowo wabedi ko, kansi kilumbu kyeka lukufi. Yobobo bana tanga ti kilumbu kyeka lukufi bana bisanga mu sala. Bana tanga ti mu sala, mpasi zimpamba kwandi zidi. Kansi bana kwe dyanga mu zinzo zi yobobo bakwe salanga. Ni hahoho, Pawuli ka basonikina, mu balonka ti kadi muntu mu kyufuta kyandi kafweti dilanga. Na wubateela dyaka baba bakangama nakekete mu ntangu zimpasi, na bafweti tatamananga mu hidika misamu mimbote.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char> )</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Mvutukulu yi Klisto yaasungika misamu mimvimba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1.3-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Mfumu Yesu kavutukidi ko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2.1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Kuba wukangama mu kiminu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:13-17">2.13-17</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Kusambila na kusala (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3.1-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Mbote zimanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3.16-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, Sila na Timote,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Tusonikini ku dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Tesalonika divwihulu ku Nzambi Tata dyeto na ku Mfumu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Bika Nzambi Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilumbu ki mfundusu yi nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Zimpangi, tufweti tatamana mu vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyeno. Bumbote budi ti tuhidika bo, kadi kiminu kyeno kina toma kula, mpe luzolo luu na kadi muntu mu zimpangi luna toma sampa. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ni hahoho, tuna luzonzila mu kyese ku Mabundu ma Nzambi, mu dyambu ti ludi bakangama nakekete mu kiminu, mpeleko zimfyetokoso na nzomono zimvimba zi luna vibidila.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Kyo ni kidimbu kina lonka ti mfundusu yi Nzambi yidedakana yidi, mwanki luba bantu balunga mu kimfumu ki Nzambi, ki luna kwe yeniningi mpasi. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Nzambi wulunungu kadi: waavutula mpasi ku bantu bakwe luyenisanga mpasi, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />mpe waahaana ku yeno luna yena mpasi mvundulu ha kimosi neto, mu ntangu Mfumu Yesu yi kaayenika ku mazulu na zimbazi zandi zilulendo, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />ha kati di milaka mi tiya, mu haana nsembolo ku yobobo balembolo zaba Nzambi na yobobo bakwe lembolo tumiminanga Musamu Wumbote wu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Nsembolo yi baabaka ni mfuukulu yi mimvu ka mimvu, kitatu na Mfumu mpe kitatu na lulendo lu nkembo andi. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Myaahilama mu kilumbu bekyokyo ki kaakwiza. Baamukembisa na baamusiika ku bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na bakwe sanga kiminu kyawu mu yandi. Mpe ni yeno lukwikidi mu kimbangi ki tulusamunini.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ni hahoho tuna tatamana mu lusambidilanga. Tuna lomba ku Nzambi eto kalulungisa mu mbokolo yi lutambula ku yandi, mpe mu lulendo lwandi, kalusadisa mu lungisa nsatu zeno ze hidika misamu mimbote, na kiminu kyeno kitoma sala. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Bwabobo, nkumbu yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto yaakembosolo ku yeno, mpe yandi kaalukembisila. Bonso budi lusakumunu lukwe haananga Nzambi eto na Mfumu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tekila mvutukulu yi Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Zimpangi, mu myo mitadidi mvutukulu yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto na kukutakana kweto ha yandi, ebu tululombidi: <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />mayindu meno mabandi yeku-yeku ko, mpe lubandi na bunkuta ko bantu bu baaluteela ti bwabu kilumbu ki Mfumu kitudidi. Ni baluteela wo bonso mbikudulu, mu nzonzolo hoti bonso mukanda wufumuni ku yeto, lukwikilandi wo ko. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Kaluhunukandi ku muntu mu mutindu nakani wumosi ko. Mu dyambu ti kilumbu bekyokyo kyaakitudila ko tekila bantu babisa mu bwesa kwikila Nzambi, mpe tekila muntu wumbalu kayenika, yondowo wuna kwenda mu zimbala. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Muntu bewowo waanwanisa bima bimvimba bebyobyo bikwe fukiminanga bantu na bi bakwe bongilanga bonso Nzambi. Waanwanisa bima bimvimba bebyobyo natee bu kaakwenda zakala mu nzo-Nzambi, mu kibika yandi bende Nzambi. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Luna bambuka moyo ko ti wanaluteela buna ba ku yeno e? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Mpe luzebi bwabu nki bina kakidila muntu wumbalu, mwanki kayenika mu ntangu andi . <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Lulendo luswekama lu muntu wumbalu luna sala, kansi yondowo wuna mukakidila bu kaakatuka, kaabwesa sala mu mansweki ko. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Buna muntu wumbalu waayenika, mpe Mfumu Yesu waamuhonda mu mupepe wu munwa andi na waamufukisa mu kyezezi ki kaakwizila. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Muntu wumbalu waakwiza na lulendo lu Satana, waasa bimangu bi mumpila-mumpila na bidimbu bingitukulu biluvunu. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Mpe waasadila misamu mimbi mi mumpila-mumpila mu hukumuna yobobo bana kwenda mu zimbala. Mu dyambu ti batambula luzolo lu kikedika luketi bavuukisa ko. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ni hahoho, Nzambi kakwe batambikilanga lulendo lu bunzimbu, luna banata mu kwikila misamu mi luvunu, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />mpe bantu bamvimba balembolo kwikila mu kikedika, kansi bayangalala mu hidika misamu mimbi, baafundusu.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi wulusoola mu tambula mpulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Zimpangi zizola mu Mfumu, yeto tufweti tatamana mu vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyeno, kadi Nzambi wulusoola tuuka ku mbadukulu mwanki lutambula mpulusu. Mu dyambu ti Mpeve Yilongo yikwe sanga ti luba na luzingu lu bulongo, mpe mu dyambu ti lukwe kwikilanga mu kikedika. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ni mu dyambu bedyodyo mpe kalutumisina mu Musamu Wumbote wu tululonga, mwanki lubaka nkembo wu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ni hahoho zimpangi, syameeno nakekete na kangameeno mu malongi ma tululonga hoti mu mpova zeto hoti mu mukanda weto.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Bika yandi bende Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto na Tata eto Nzambi wututya na wutuhaana mu lusakumunu lwandi nsyamusunu yi mimvu ka mimvu na kivuvu kimbote, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />kalusyamisa na kalukindisa mu bisalu byeno bimvimba bimbote mpe mu mpova zimbote!<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tusambidileeno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Zimpangi, mu manisa, tusambidilangeeno, mwanki Mambu ma Mfumu matatamana mu mwangana na bantu bakembisa mo bonso yeno bu lukwe me kembisilanga. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Sambileeno mpe Nzambi katukuula mu bantu bambi na bambalu. Mu dyambu ti bamvimba baa na kiminu ko.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Kansi Mfumu wukwikama kadi. Waalusyamisa na waalukeba mu Munga Mbi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Tutomini sa kivuvu mu Mfumu, mu dyambu dyeno, ti lukwe sanga na lwaatatamana mu sa misamu mi tulutumini.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Bika Mfumu katwadisa mitima myeno mu toma tya Nzambi na mu ba na mvibudulu bonso Klisto.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bumbote mu sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Zimpangi, tuna lulomba mu nkumbu yi Mfumu eto Yesu Klisto: beeno kitatu na zimpangi zimvimba zikwe dyatilanga mu mvwanzi na zikwe lembolo landanga ndongosolo zi tubalonga. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Yebende luzebi bwedi lufweti landila kifwani kyeto, mu dyambu ti tudyatila mu mvwanzi ha kati dyeno ko. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Tulomba ku muntu mu tudikila ko, kansi bu tutambula mpasi na lebakani, tusala mpimpa na mwini mu lembolo ba kizitu ku muntu ha kati dyeno. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tudyatila bobo, ka mu dyambu ti tuba na luve mu tambula lusadusu lweno ko, kansi tutya mu ba kuu yeno kifwani ki lufweti landa. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Kadi bu tuba ku yeno, tuluhaana ntumunu eyi: «Tala ti muntu katiidi mu sala ko, kabika mpe mu dya!»<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Kadi tuna yuwanga ti bahiika ha kati dyeno, bana dyatilanga mu mvwanzi, bakwe salanga ko, kansi yawu ni mukwe kotingi mu misamu mingana. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Ku bantu bebobo tuna balomba, tuna batuma mu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu-Klisto: basala mu kizunu mu baka mu kyufuta kyawu bindya bi yawu bende.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ku yeno zimpangi zeto, ka lulebakanandi mu hidika misamu mimbote ko. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Tala ti muntu kana tumimina mi tuna ta mu mukanda bewuwu ko, tomeeno we simbidila na lubandi kintwadi nandi mwanki kafwa nsoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ka lumubongilandi bonso mutantu ko, kansi mulubuleeno bonso mpangi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusakumunu na zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Bika Mfumu yi kiyenge kaluhaana yandi bende kiyenge mu ntangu zimvimba na mu mimvimba! Bika Mfumu kaba na yeno bamvimba!<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Meno Pawuli, nina sonika mbote bezizi mu kooko kwani. Bwabobo nakwe silanga kinyemo mu mikanda myani mimvimba, yoyo ni nsonokono ani.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Bika Mfumu eto Yesu-KListo kalusakumuna yeno bamvimba!<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>